1.) Use the megaTiny compiler tool chain. 

2.) Use the C++14 language standard version.

3.) For flashing to Attiny: 

pymcuprog write -t uart -u /dev/cu.usbserial-0001 -d attiny1614 -f LcsDrvAvrLib-Test.hex

// or a script ...
#!/bin/bash

PORT=/dev/cu.usbserial-0001
MCU=attiny1614

HEX=$(ls bin/*/*.hex | tail -n 1)

pymcuprog write -t uart -u $PORT -d $MCU -f "$HEX"

4.) watch out for 1616 / 1614 differences. 

5.) alternative: 

avrdude -p attiny1614 -c serialupdi -P /dev/tty.usbserial-0001 -b 115200 -U flash:w:firmware.hex:i

